<#
.SYNOPSIS
    {{COMPANY_NAME}} — Shared PowerShell module for Fabric deployment.
.DESCRIPTION
    Provides helper functions for deploying the {{COMPANY_NAME}} demo
    to a Microsoft Fabric workspace via REST API and OneLake DFS.
